    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartRoot x EndRoot plus 300\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>300</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 81\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow></math>?</p>",
