    "difficulty": "easy",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The graph of the exponential function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is shown, where <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>. The <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
    "correctAnswer": "3",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math>. For the graph of the exponential function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> shown, where <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, it's given that the <em>y</em>-intercept of the graph is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The graph intersects the <em>y</em>-axis at the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma 3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"3\"><mn>3</mn></math>.</p>",
