    "subtopicId": "nonlinear-functions",
    "subtopic": "Nonlinear functions & quadratics",
    "difficulty": "easy",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue x plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><mo>|</mo></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "D",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. The value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> is the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> when <math alttext=\"x equals 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mrow></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"4\"><mn>4</mn></math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the given equation yields <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue 4 plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue 22 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mn>22</mn></mfenced></math>, or <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis equals 22\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> is <math alttext=\"22\"><mn>22</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This would be the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> if function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> was defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus StartAbsoluteValue 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mn>18</mn></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue x plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This would be the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> if function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> was defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus StartAbsoluteValue x EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue x plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This would be the value of <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math> if function <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> was defined by <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue negative x plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, not <math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartAbsoluteValue x plus 18 EndAbsoluteValue\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>",
