    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The <em>x</em>-intercept of the graph shown is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
    "correctAnswer": "7",
    "explanation": "<p>The correct answer is <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn></math>. It&rsquo;s given that the <em>x</em>-intercept of the graph shown is <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. The graph passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Therefore, the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn></math>. </p>",
