    "stem": "<p>The function <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"p left parenthesis n right parenthesis equals 7 n cubed\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"n\"><mi>n</mi></math> when <math alttext=\"p left parenthesis n right parenthesis\"><mi>p</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to <math alttext=\"56\"><mn>56</mn></math>?</p>",
