        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"q left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 14 left parenthesis 0.55 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0.55</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>"
