        "id": "A",
        "text": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A normal paraffin with a molecular weight of <math alttext=\"186.05\"><mn>186.05</mn></math> grams per mole has an estimated boiling point of <math alttext=\"149.02\"><mn>149.02</mn></math> degrees Celsius.</p>"
