    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 10 x squared minus 32 x minus 152\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>152</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math>?</p>",
