        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"left parenthesis negative 12 comma 0 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
