        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis one twenty fifth right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>"
