        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 205 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x minus 2\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>205</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
