    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.84 right parenthesis Superscript StartFraction x Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1.84</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></msup></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by the given equation. The equation can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1 plus StartFraction p Over 100 EndFraction right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>, where <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math> is a constant. Which of the following is closest to the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "A",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is correct. The equation <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.84 right parenthesis Superscript StartFraction x Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1.84</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math> can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.84 right parenthesis Superscript left parenthesis one fourth right parenthesis left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1.84</mn></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.84 Superscript one fourth Baseline right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><msup><mn>1.84</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>, or approximately <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.16467 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1.16467</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>. Since it's given that <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1.84 right parenthesis Superscript StartFraction x Over 4 EndFraction\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>1.84</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math> can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis 1 plus StartFraction p Over 100 EndFraction right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math>, where <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math> is a constant, it follows that <math alttext=\"1 plus StartFraction p Over 100 EndFraction\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math> is approximately equal to <math alttext=\"1.16467\"><mn>1.16467</mn></math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"StartFraction p Over 100 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math> is approximately equal to <math alttext=\"0.16467\"><mn>0.16467</mn></math>. It follows that the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math> is approximately equal to <math alttext=\"16.467\"><mn>16.467</mn></math>. Of the given choices, <math alttext=\"16\"><mn>16</mn></math> is closest to the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>",
