        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 6 left parenthesis x minus 5 right parenthesis squared plus 24\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mfenced>\n\t\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t</mfenced>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>24</mn>\n</mrow></math></p>"
