    "difficulty": "hard",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a Superscript x Baseline plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> are constants and <math alttext=\"a greater than 0\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. In the <em>xy</em>-plane, the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> has a <em>y</em>-intercept at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 25 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> and passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 comma 23 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>. What is the value of <math alttext=\"a plus b\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>a</mi>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mi>b</mi>\n</mrow></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
    "correctAnswer": "-19",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The correct answer is <math alttext=\"negative 19\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>19</mn>\n</mrow></math>. It's given that function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a Superscript x Baseline plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> are constants and <math alttext=\"a greater than 0\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. It's also given that the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane has a <em>y</em>-intercept at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 25 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 comma 23 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Since the graph has a <em>y</em>-intercept at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 0 comma negative 25 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals negative 25\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn></math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the given equation yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals a Superscript 0 Baseline plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, or <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis equals 1 plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>, and substituting <math alttext=\"negative 25\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>25</mn>\n</mrow></math> for <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math> in this equation yields <math alttext=\"negative 25 equals 1 plus b\"><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. Subtracting <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> from each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"negative 26 equals b\"><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"negative 26\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>26</mn>\n</mrow></math> for <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math> in the equation <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a Superscript x Baseline plus b\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a Superscript x Baseline minus 26\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></math>. Since the graph also passes through the point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 2 comma 23 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals 23\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn></math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the equation <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a Superscript x Baseline minus 26\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis equals a squared minus 26\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></math>, and substituting <math alttext=\"23\"><mn>23</mn></math> for <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> yields <math alttext=\"23 equals a squared minus 26\"><mn>23</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></math>. Adding <math alttext=\"26\"><mn>26</mn></math> to each side of this equation yields <math alttext=\"49 equals a squared\"><mn>49</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. Taking the square root of both sides of this equation yields <math alttext=\"plus or minus 7 equals a\"><mo>&plusmn;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>. Since it's given that <math alttext=\"a greater than 0\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the value of <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"7\"><mn>7</mn></math>. It follows that the value of <math alttext=\"a plus b\"><mrow>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mi>b</mi>\n</mrow></math> is <math alttext=\"7 minus 26\"><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></math>, or <math alttext=\"negative 19\"><mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>19</mn>\n</mrow></math>.</p>"
