        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"h equals minus 16 left parenthesis t minus 1.8 right parenthesis squared plus 51.84\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>h</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t<mn>16</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mfenced>\n\t\t\t\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mi>t</mi>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<mn>1.8</mn>\n\t\t\t\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t\t\t</mfenced>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>51.84</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow></math></p>"
