    "domainName": "2. Advanced Math",
    "subtopicId": "nonlinear-functions",
    "subtopic": "Nonlinear functions & quadratics",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "stem": "<p>The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> gives the product of a number, <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>, and a number that is <math alttext=\"91\"><mn>91</mn></math> more than <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math>. Which equation defines <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math>?</p>",
