    "subtopicId": "nonlinear-functions",
    "subtopic": "Nonlinear functions & quadratics",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x minus 44 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 46 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>44</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>46</mn></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The function <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> is defined by the given equation. For what value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> does <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> reach its minimum? </p>",
    "type": "mcq",
    "correctAnswer": "B",
    "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. It's given that <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals left parenthesis x minus 44 right parenthesis left parenthesis x minus 46 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>44</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, which can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x squared minus 90 x plus 2,024\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>90</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2,024</mn></math>. Since the coefficient of the <math alttext=\"x squared\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>-term is positive, the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane opens upward and reaches its minimum value at its vertex. For an equation in the form <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals a x squared plus b x plus c\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi></math>, <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi></math>, and <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi></math> are constants, the <em>x</em>-coordinate of the vertex is <math alttext=\"minus StartFraction b Over 2 a EndFraction\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. For the equation <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x squared minus 90 x plus 2,024\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>90</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2,024</mn></math>, <math alttext=\"a equals 1\"><mrow>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow></math>, <math alttext=\"b equals negative 90\"><mrow>\n<mi>b</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mrow>\n<mo>-</mo>\n<mn>90</mn>\n</mrow>\n</mrow></math>, and <math alttext=\"c equals 2,024\"><mrow>\n<mi>c</mi>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>2,024</mn>\n</mrow></math>. It follows that the <em>x</em>-coordinate of the vertex is <math alttext=\"minus StartFraction left parenthesis negative 90 right parenthesis Over 2 left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis EndFraction\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"45\"><mn>45</mn></math>. Therefore, <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> reaches its minimum when the value of <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> is <math alttext=\"45\"><mn>45</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is one of the <em>x</em>-coordinates of the <em>x</em>-intercepts of the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is one of the <em>x</em>-coordinates of the <em>x</em>-intercepts of the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is the <em>y</em>-coordinate of the vertex of the graph of <math alttext=\"y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> in the <em>xy</em>-plane.</p>",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"46\"><mn>46</mn></math></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"45\"><mn>45</mn></math></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"44\"><mn>44</mn></math></p>"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "<p><math alttext=\"negative 1\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
      }
    ]
