        "id": "A",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"choice_cell align:right \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"negative 4\"></span></span></span></p>"
