    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The functions <math alttext=\"f\"><mi>f</mi></math> and <math alttext=\"g\"><mi>g</mi></math> are defined by the given equations, where <math alttext=\"x greater than or equals 0\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Which of the following equations displays, as a constant or coefficient, the maximum value of the function it defines, where <math alttext=\"x greater than or equals 0\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>?</p>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-roman;\">\n<li><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 18 left parenthesis 1.25 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline plus 41\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1.25</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>41</mn></math></li>\n<li><math alttext=\"g left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 9 left parenthesis 0.73 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>0.73</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></li>\n</ol>",
